#solution[
#grid(columns: (1fr, 25%), gutter: 1em, [过 $M$ 作 $M H tack.t N B$ 于 $H$ , 

 $because$ 四边形 $A B C D$ 是菱形, 

 $therefore A C tack.t B D$ , $A B=B C=A D=2$ , $A D parallel B C$ , 

 $because angle A B C=60 degree$ , 

 $therefore triangle A B C$ 是等边三角形, 

 $therefore A C=A B=2$ , $angle A C B=60 degree$ , 

 $because B M tack.t A C$ , 

 $therefore C M= (1 )/(2 ) A C=1$ , 

 $because angle C M H=90 degree - angle A C B=30 degree$ , 

 $therefore C H= (1 )/(2 ) C M= (1 )/(2 )$ , 

 $because tan angle M C H=tan 60 degree = (M H )/(C H ) = sqrt(3 )$ , 

 $therefore M H= (sqrt(3 ) )/(2 )$ , 

 $because D N parallel A C$ , 

 $therefore$ 四边形 $A C N D$ 是平行四边形, 

 $therefore C N=A D=2$ , 

 $therefore N H=C H+C N= (5 )/(2 )$ , 

 $therefore M N= sqrt(M H ^(2 ) + N H ^(2 ) ) = sqrt(7 )$ . 

故答案为: $sqrt(7 )$ . 
], [#align(center + top, image("images/12b594ee.png", width: 100%))])
